IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-KVR-REROUTE.

DATA DIVISION.
01 NUM-PAGES           PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BANDWIDTH-GBPS      PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 LATENCY-US          PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 BALANCE-PCT         PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-KVR.
    MOVE 900 TO BANDWIDTH-GBPS.
    MOVE 850 TO LATENCY-US.
    MOVE 98 TO BALANCE-PCT.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NUM-PAGES.
    WEIGHT 30 BALANCE-PCT.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
